</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Favor_Rewards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Favor Rewards\">Favor Rewards</a></b>, 150 House Phiarlan favor (Commended)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Warp_Time\" title=\"Warp Time\">Warp Time</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Warp_Time\" title=\"Warp Time\">Warp Time</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 10<br /><b>Charges: </b>1 (1/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 1 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:1)</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Phiarlan%27s_Pendent_of_Time.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Phiarlan%27s_Pendent_of_Time.png/420px-Phiarlan%27s_Pendent_of_Time.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"357\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Phiarlan%27s_Pendent_of_Time.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This intricate, clock-like pendant is able to warp the effect of time on the bearer, effectively increasing run speed. The enchantment is delicate though and is only usable while there are no hostile entities around.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>This clicky provides a permanent +50% enhancement bonus to <a href=\"/page/Run_speed\" title=\"Run speed\">Run speed</a>. Duration is unlimited, however it only usable in public areas and will be removed upon entering any quest/adventure, and (annoyingly) also upon login if you were logged out for more than 2 hours.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816191202\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.081 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.156 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3198/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20092/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5499/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n164.77%  235.242     40 Template:IO\n100.00%  142.768      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  142.768      1 -total\n 97.24%  138.829      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 55.59%   79.365      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 54.68%   78.065      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 53.72%   76.691      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 52.67%   